            "created_at": "2025-09-03T03:03:59.416994+00:00",
            "notes": "Here I'm trying to build as much into reducing cooldowns as I can while keeping my weapon power high enough to keep my team healed. I want to be able to use Rez whenever it's needed so that I can benefit from Valk/Supply Surge. If you're struggling with heals, I'd take a boost to weapon power if I can afford it.\n\nI don't always take [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) but if I think I need either the extra CD reduction *OR* the space to Rez safely, I'll grab it anywhere from Round 5 or on. Some of the choices start to be assessing what your team needs based on the match ups in your games.",
